nted to Globex by this Agreement, expressly or by implication. Globex shall not, by virtue of this Agreement, acquire any rights in Acme's Confidential Information other than the limited right to use it for the Purpose.","placeholders":[]},{"title":"Return or Destruction of Materials","summary":"Requires Globex to return or destroy Confidential Information on request or termination.","drafted_clause":"Upon Acme's written request or upon expiration or termination of this Agreement, Globex shall promptly return to Acme or destroy all Confidential Information in its possession or control, including all copies, extracts, and derivatives, and shall certify such return or destruction in writing within [RETURN OR DESTRUCTION PERIOD]. Globex may retain one copy of Confidential Information to the extent required by law or by its document-retention policies, provided that such retained copy remains subject to the confidentiality obligations of this Agreement for so long as it is retained.","placeholders":["[RETURN OR DESTRUCTION PERIOD]"]},{"title":"Term and Survival","summary":"Sets the term of the agreement and the survival period of confidentiality obligations.","drafted_clause":"This Agreement begins on the Effective Date and continues for [INITIAL TERM] unless terminated earlier by written agreement of the parties or by either party on [TERMINATION NOTICE PERIOD] written notice. The confidentiality obligations of Globex with respect to Confidential Information disclosed during the term of this Agreement shall survive expiration or termination for [CONFIDENTIALITY SURVIVAL PERIOD]; obligations with respect to information that constitutes a trade secret under applicable law shall survive for so long as such information remains a trade secret.","placeholders":["[INITIAL TERM]","[TERMINATION NOTICE PERIOD]","[CONFIDENTIALITY SURVIVAL PERIOD]"]},{"title":"Remedies and Injunctive Relief","summary":"Acknowledges that money damages may be inadequate and preserves Acme's right to